: "700"}, {"type": "text", "id": "XwVMGi", "name": "State", "content": "Light · 选中最新一条，悬停第 5 张", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 17, "fill": "$accent", "fontWeight": "600"}, {"type": "frame", "id": "H2CLTw", "name": "Gap", "width": 10, "height": 6}, {"type": "text", "id": "Nkkj2q", "name": "Note", "content": "竖排的小卡片，每张 2–3 行：句子能多读半句，命令完整显示，链接是“网站 + 标题”两行，图片 / 颜色 / 文件左边带实物。", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "lineHeight": 1.6, "width": "fill_container"}, {"type": "text", "id": "WmWGsD", "name": "Note", "content": "不画标题栏，也不放 App 图标：卡片左边一条 3 pt 的细色边就是来源 App 的颜色——绿是微信、蓝是飞书、紫是 Figma、灰是终端。一句话放得下的短句，第二行用灰字写来源窗口（群名、频道、邮件主题），不写时间。", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "lineHeight": 1.6, "width": "fill_container"}, {"type": "text", "id": "SdVsW2", "name": "Note", "content": "时间只在悬停 / 选中卡片的右侧出现。面板出现在鼠标所在位置。", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 15, "fill": "$t2", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "lineHeight": 1.6, "width": "fill_container"}, {"type": "frame", "id": "4CQnhB", "name": "Gap", "width": 10, "height": 4}, {"type": "text", "id": "X4UjpD", "name": "Spec", "content": "380 pt 宽 · 卡片 56–76 pt · 一屏 11 张", "fontFamily": "Inter", "fontSize": 13, "fill": "$t3", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "lineHeight": 1.6, "width": "fill_container"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "SXFXHX", "name": "N2 · Dark · Selected", "x": 1820, "y": 0, "width": 1720, "height": 880, "theme": {"mode": "dark"}, "fill": "$canvas", "clip": true, "layout": "none", "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "1qaxrm", "name": "Screen · 1280 × 800", "x": 40, "y": 40, "width": 1280, "height": 800, "fill": {"type": "mesh_gradient", "columns": 3, "rows": 3, "colors": ["$w1", "$w5", "$w2", "$w4", "$w1", "$w6", "$w3", "$w4", "$w2"], "points": [[0, 0], [0.5, 0], [1, 0], [0, 0.5], [0.42, 0.58], [1, 0.5], [0, 1], [0.5, 1], [1, 1]]}, "cornerRadius": 14, "clip": true, "layout": "none", "stroke": "$hair", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeAlignm